<header><h1>🏗️ Compras Prisbel</h1><small>Painel de Pedidos — MVP</small><span style="flex:1"></span><button class="b sec" style="background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:#ffffff88" onclick="carregarTudo()">↻ Atualizar</button></header>
<nav>
<button id="tb-ped" class="on" onclick="aba('ped')">📋 Pedidos</button>
<button id="tb-req" onclick="aba('req')">✅ Requisitos</button>
